The grasp detection methods and the benchmark evaluators in this repository are written
from the cited papers and from behavioural study of the reference implementations; no
source file of those repositories is copied. Licences of upstream repositories, datasets
and released weights are recorded per method in configs/<method>/metafile.yaml.

Some components are adapted from third-party code under the MIT, BSD or Apache-2.0
licence. Each such file keeps the upstream copyright notice; THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md lists
them with repository, commit and licence. Components that bridge to an optional library
(their status is "bridge") contain none of that library's code; a bridge that also adapts
source from a research repository is listed there for that source. Image-encoder bridges
can fetch pretrained weights through their library; those weights carry the licence of
their authors (some are non-commercial) and are not part of this software.

GraspNet-1Billion (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0) and GraspClutter6D (CC BY-SA 4.0) are datasets of
their respective authors and are not distributed with this software.

resources/demo.webp shows one frame of GraspNet-1Billion with grasps predicted by this
software. The underlying image and depth data are (c) the GraspNet-1Billion authors and
licensed CC BY-NC-SA 4.0; that file is not covered by the Apache License and is not
part of the distributed packages.
